WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:07.140
Your life is dictated by the weight and length&nbsp;
of grains. Seriously. The pound was originally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:15.360
defined by the weight of 7000 grains and the&nbsp;
inch was originally defined by the length of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:21.420
three barley corns placed end to end. Who knows&nbsp;
what a barley corn is? We still use it like we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:26.520
still. I still use that. That's the thing I use.&nbsp;
What happened? Well, we know what happened. We&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:30.540
know that the rest of the world got on board with&nbsp;
a system that was pegged to the Earth and that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:38.760
was all multiplied by ten and very logical and&nbsp;
just– But then three countries didn't. And I've&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:43.260
been thinking about that a lot. I made a whole&nbsp;
video diving way too deep into this. So you can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:48.480
go watch that. But just remember that if you live&nbsp;
in the USA or one of these other two countries.

